      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is not a Udon-related problem but just how C# works.\nTrying to convert a Char to a float will always throw an InvalidCastException (as stated in the official microsoft .NET/C# documentaiton):\nhttps://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/api/system.convert.tosingle?view=netframework-4.8#System_Convert_ToSingle_System_Char_",
      "viewerReactions": null
