  "details": "Udon Version: UDONSDK-2019.12.22.12.32_Public\nVRCSDK Version: VRCSDK3-2019.12.21.16.01\n\nExample asset:\nhttps://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/651097443068411949/661327397844418562/CharToFloat.asset\n\nError details:\n[<color=yellow>UdonBehaviour</color>] VRC.Udon.VM.UdonVMException: The VM encountered an error!\nException Message:\n  An exception occurred during EXTERN to 'SystemConvert.__ToSingle__SystemChar__SystemSingle'.\n  Invalid cast from 'Char' to 'Single'.\n----------------------\nProgram Counter was at: 42\n----------------------\nStack Dump:\n----------------------\nHeap Dump:\n  0: M\n  1: M\n  2: 0\n  3: null\n  4: M\n  5: UnityEngineDebug.__Log__SystemObject__SystemVoid\n  6: SystemConvert.__ToSingle__SystemChar__SystemSingle\n----------------------\nInner Exception:\n ---> VRC.Udon.VM.UdonVMException: An exception occurred during EXTERN to 'SystemConvert.__ToSingle__SystemChar__SystemSingle'. ---> System.InvalidCastException: Invalid cast from 'Char' to 'Single'.\n  at System.Char.System.IConvertible.ToSingle (System.IFormatProvider provider) [0x00020] in <e1319b7195c343e79b385cd3aa43f5dc>:0 \n  at System.Convert.ToSingle (System.Char value) [0x00000] in <e1319b7195c343e79b385cd3aa43f5dc>:0 \n  at VRC.Udon.Wrapper.Modules.ExternSystemConvert.__ToSingle__SystemChar__SystemSingle (VRC.Udon.Common.Interfaces.IUdonHeap heap, System.UInt32[] parameterAddresses) [0x00009] in C:\\VRChatGit\\UdonVM\\Udon\\Wrapper\\Source\\Modules\\System\\ExternSystemConvert.cs:3384 \n  at VRC.Udon.VM.UdonVM.Interpret () [0x002bf] in C:\\VRChatGit\\UdonVM\\Udon\\VM\\Source\\UdonVM.cs:235 \n   --- End of inner exception stack trace ---\n  at VRC.Udon.VM.UdonVM.Interpret () [0x002db] in C:\\VRChatGit\\UdonVM\\Udon\\VM\\Source\\UdonVM.cs:239 \n   --- End of inner exception stack trace ---\n  at VRC.Udon.VM.UdonVM.Interpret () [0x0038f] in C:\\VRChatGit\\UdonVM\\Udon\\VM\\Source\\UdonVM.cs:275 \n  at VRC.Udon.UdonBehaviour.RunProgram (System.UInt32 entryPoint) [0x0001b] in G:\\Files\\Documents\\Unity\\VRChat Udon Test\\Assets\\Udon\\UdonBehaviour.cs:1860 \n\nEdited: Added versions, moved asset file to top of description",
